✅ 收到！
你現在的 CustPurposeOfAcc 是多值欄位（用 | 分隔），只要每個被 | 分開的數字都在允許清單裡，就算是正確的。
允許的代碼（共 10 種）
01, 03, 04, 06, 10, 11, 15, 21, 38, 99

幫你驗證的 SQL（推薦使用）
WITH SplitValues AS (
    SELECT 
        b.CustPurposeOfAcc,
        a.NEW_CIF_KEY,
        a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY,
        TRIM(value) AS single_code
    FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP a
    JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b ON a.SOURCE_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
    CROSS APPLY STRING_SPLIT(b.CustPurposeOfAcc, '|') 
    WHERE b.CustPurposeOfAcc IS NOT NULL
)
SELECT 
    CustPurposeOfAcc,
    NEW_CIF_KEY,
    SOURCE_CIF_KEY,
    single_code,
    '❌ 不合法代碼' AS 問題
FROM SplitValues
WHERE single_code NOT IN ('01','03','04','06','10','11','15','21','38','99')
  AND single_code <> ''
ORDER BY CustPurposeOfAcc;

如果你想一次看到「有哪些不合法的值」：
WITH SplitValues AS (
    SELECT 
        b.CustPurposeOfAcc,
        TRIM(value) AS single_code
    FROM Customer_Migrate_buffer b
    CROSS APPLY STRING_SPLIT(b.CustPurposeOfAcc, '|')
    WHERE b.CustPurposeOfAcc IS NOT NULL
)
SELECT DISTINCT single_code AS 不合法代碼
FROM SplitValues
WHERE single_code NOT IN ('01','03','04','06','10','11','15','21','38','99')
  AND single_code <> ''
ORDER BY single_code;

